---
import ClimbingLayout from "../../layouts/ClimbingLayout.astro";
import styles from "../../styles/pages/climbing/cAbout.module.scss";
---

<ClimbingLayout title="about" noindex>
  <div class={styles.cAbout}>
    <h2>about</h2>

    <div class={styles.content}>
      <p>
        what ever happened to blogs?? yea yea maybe they're a bit silly in the
        2020's since social media is Anywhere And Everywhere, but cmon dude. if
        everyone had a blog i think people would be a lot happier.
      </p>
      <p>
        i love rock climbing. i really REALLY love rock climbing, so i figured
        i'd make a place to write my thoughts over my progression in the sport,
        and how i'm currently feeling about it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</ClimbingLayout>
